PROJECT NAME: SHOPZA

PROJECT TYPE: Professional, production-ready, multi-vendor
e-commerce marketplace.

PRIMARY OBJECTIVE:

Transform my existing Shopza application into a complete,
professional, fully functional e-commerce marketplace.

IMPORTANT: I am not asking for a demo, prototype, mockup, or
frontend-only application.

I want a REAL application with a properly configured backend,
persistent database, secure authentication, real product data,
working customer and seller accounts, real order processing,
buyer-seller messaging, product reviews, store following,
notifications, and an administrator dashboard.

Every feature must connect to the backend and database.

Do not create buttons that only change the interface without
performing their intended actions.

Do not use fake products, fake users, fake sales, fake reviews,
fake orders, fake notifications, hardcoded dashboard statistics,
or simulated payment confirmations.

If a feature cannot be fully implemented because credentials,
external services, or configuration are missing, explain what
is missing and implement everything that can be completed safely.

